{"id":"heureusement","lemma":"heureusement","pos":"adv","rank":1229,"glosses":["luckily, fortunately","happily"],"ipa":"/œ.ʁøz.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/85/Fr-heureusement.ogg/Fr-heureusement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Heureusement, on a un plan.","en":"Luckily, we have a plan.","words":[null,{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"map"}]},{"text":"Heureusement, personne ne fut blessé.","en":"Luckily nobody got injured.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2280","words":[null,{"g":"no one, nobody"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"injured, wounded"}]},{"text":"Heureusement, le temps était au beau.","en":"Luckily, the weather was good.","words":[null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"handsome"}]},{"text":"Heureusement, ils ont pu s'échapper.","en":"Fortunately, they were able to escape.","words":[null,{"g":"they"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to escape , evade"}]},{"text":"Heureusement personne n'a été tué.","en":"Luckily nobody got killed.","words":[null,{"g":"no one, nobody"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"to kill","l":"tuer"}]}]}